<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fell in 3-mos to end August.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fell in 3-mos to end August.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts in April.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end     12-mos to end</p>
<p>				August 1996     August 1996</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  75,300	  300,800</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		 -4.9	     -11.6</p>
<p> STARTED			66,100	  276,100</p>
<p> (percent)			-3.9	     -7.2</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		 9.02 million	33.52 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -6.7	     -4.0</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.82 million	31.69 million</p>
<p> percent			  -0.2	     +1.2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
